{"unit_id": "Yihong89__dsh-companion#feature-feature-1", "repo": "Yihong89/dsh-companion", "commit": "50c084adb81c13f919c38e7e9929befae66809d6", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "dsh-companion 的功能「人设与声音配置」：点击会话标题旁的人设按钮，可编辑搭档名字、性格、预设声音或自定义声音描述，并试听后保存到该会话。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["lib/client.js:109-135", "lib/client.js:215-245", "lib/persona-store.js:64-85"]}
